  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Elevate your 9-to-5 style with our new Bleecker tote. This designer tote bag is made from durable Saffiano leather with plenty of room for your everyday essentials (including a 13\" laptop). Featuring an interior zip pocket for your smaller knick-knacks, this large tote bag is perfect for school or work. Check out the Bleecker collection if you're looking for a canvas tote bag, a leather tote bag or tote bags in other classic fabrications—there's so many to choose from. We update the totes in new colors and prints every season, so you can collect them to complement your various warm and cold weather looks.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Saffiano leather</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Strap drop: 11&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: Inside zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 13.75&quot; (L) x 11.75&quot; (H) x 5.25&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
